# Daiquiri (TAP service integration, issue #197)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Base URL of the Daiquiri instance backing the public catalogs' TAP service.
# Local dev: the Daiquiri nginx container's host-published port (see
# lsp_daiquiri/docker-compose.yml), reached via host.docker.internal since
# it's a separate docker-compose project on its own network.
DAIQUIRI_BASE_URL=http://host.docker.internal:81
# Shared secret used to mint/validate service-to-service JWTs between Canvas
# and Daiquiri (target.metadata.daiquiri_auth.mint_service_token on this
# side, linea.authentication.ServiceJWTAuthentication on Daiquiri's). No
# default - must be set, and must match CANVAS_SERVICE_JWT_SECRET in
# Daiquiri's own .env exactly (same value, variable name differs by design).
DAIQUIRI_SERVICE_JWT_SECRET=
# Optional - HTTP timeout (seconds) for a single Daiquiri TAP request, and
# the sleep interval (seconds) between two status checks of the same
# Daiquiri job while polling. Defaults: 10 and 3.
# DAIQUIRI_JOB_POLL_TIMEOUT_S=10
# DAIQUIRI_JOB_POLL_INTERVAL_S=3
